{"type":"TEXT","ticket":3619,"id":"6a1c47876262f690"}||{"x":150,"y":-850,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":12,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"CENTER_BOTTOM","value":"电源与接口\nUSB_VBUS_RAW：USB 原始输入；VBUS_FUSED：保险丝后输入\nVSYS：充电芯片系统输出；3V3：主控、传感器与马达电源\nJ2 电池接口：1 正极 / 2 负极 / 3 温度检测，线束须按此定义\nJ3 扬声器、J4 马达均为桥接输出，任一端不得接地\nUSB_D_PLUS / MINUS：PCB 差分对，目标阻抗按板厂叠层计算","fillColor":null,"zIndex":1149}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":3620,"id":"8f629bcffe15aafb"}||{"x":1500,"y":-850,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":null,"fontSize":12,"fontWeight":false,"italic":null,"underline":null,"align":"CENTER_BOTTOM","value":"按键与固件接口\nSW1 左键 GPIO12；SW2 右键 GPIO13\nSW3 背部语音 GPIO14；SW4 背部绘制 GPIO21\nSW5 电源管理键：接 TS/MR，短按中断 / 长按硬件复位\nSW6 下载键 GPIO0；SW7 主控复位 EN\nU2 I²C 地址 0x68；U5 0x6A；U6 0x5A\nI²S：32 kHz、双声道 32-bit 槽、BCLK = 64 × WS","fillColor":null,"zIndex":1150}